  "overrides": {
    "react": "18.3.1",
    "react-dom": "18.3.1"
  },
  "comment:overrides": "React stays on 18.3.1 (Decision 0001) and we force a single copy of each @wordpress store singleton. The whole-tree pin to isolated-block-editor@2.30.0 bundled versions is gone: we now depend on @wordpress/block-editor directly at the current release line, so the tree resolves coherently without the old override map. (Decision 0021.)"
